# Screen Time Control monorepo
# apps: web-dashboard (Vite/React), windows-agent (Python), android-agent (Kotlin)
# packages: shared-rules-engine, shared-schemas | firebase: functions, hosting, emulators

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

